# Inkflow Configuration Example
#
# To supply your Google Books API key securely without committing it to git:
# 1. Open or create `android/local.properties` (or `local.properties` in the project root).
# 2. Add your Google Books API Key:
#
#    GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=your_actual_google_books_api_key_here
#
# Note: `local.properties` is listed in `.gitignore` and is NEVER committed to Git.
#
# Alternatively, you can run the app with --dart-define:
#    flutter run --dart-define=GOOGLE_BOOKS_API_KEY=your_key_here
# Or using --dart-define-from-file:
#    flutter run --dart-define-from-file=local.properties
